## Actions

1. Add labs: Meta (Llama family), DeepSeek, xAI (Grok), Alibaba
   (Qwen). Optionally Cohere, AI21, Reka.
2. For each new lab, fill the seven-stage matrix: instruct / RAG /
   web / reasoning / deep research / general agent / agent teams.
   Primary announcement URLs only (per the discipline used in
   the existing matrix).
3. Produce a figure: x-axis time, y-axis lab, markers per stage
   shipped. Render to PDF in the appropriate `inputs/generated/`
   directory or wherever paper figures live.
4. Update `argument.md` (after 0147) §"Why the order is observed,
   not forced" to cite the expanded matrix and reference the
   figure.
5. Honest gaps subsection: list cells where primary sourcing
   failed; do not paper over them.

## Exit criteria

- `capability-timeline.md` matrix has ≥7 labs.
- Figure rendered and committed; renders cleanly via `make` or
  the standard build.
- Bibliography contains primary URLs for each non-empty cell.
- Honest-gaps subsection updated; no silent omissions.
